{"_meta":{"openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Cuota estimada","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Calculando la cuota de aut\u00f3nomos","securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Use this when someone asks how much cuota de aut\u00f3nomos (RETA, Seguridad Social) they would pay in Spain, or which tramo applies, from expected yearly income and expenses. Assumes a full year of activity as a persona f\u00edsica aut\u00f3noma (not societario) in estimaci\u00f3n directa simplificada of the common IRPF, income and expenses without recoverable VAT and without their own cuota, the 5 % allowance for gastos de dif\u00edcil justificaci\u00f3n (at most 2,000 EUR a year) and then the general 7 % deduction for generic expenses. The tramo table is the same in all of Spain, but the rendimiento is computed with these common-regime rules: under m\u00f3dulos, estimaci\u00f3n directa normal or the foral IRPF of Pa\u00eds Vasco and Navarra the tramo may differ. Does not decide whether they qualify for the tarifa plana. Do not use for employees, for companies or for a connected client's real payments.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"annual_expenses":{"maximum":100000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"annual_income":{"maximum":100000000,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"year":{"enum":[2025,2026],"type":"integer"}},"required":["year","annual_income","annual_expenses"],"type":"object"},"name":"kuotia_estimate_reta","outputSchema":{"oneOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"assumptions":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"gasto_dificil_justificacion":{"pattern":"^-?\\d+\\.\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"gastos_genericos":{"pattern":"^-?\\d+\\.\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"links":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"label":{"type":"string"},"url":{"format":"uri","type":"string"}},"required":["label","url"],"type":"object"},"type":"ar